  "model": "gpt-5.4",
  "answer": "# Markdown Briefing\n\n## Conclusion\n**ILPA did not publish a bucket assignment or numerical score for KKR** under the **ILPA ESG Assessment Framework** based on the provided evidence.\n\n## What the evidence shows\n- The framework includes four possible buckets:\n  - **Not Present**\n  - **Developing**\n  - **Intermediate**\n  - **Advanced**\n- However, the materials provided **do not show KKR being assigned to any of these buckets**.\n- ILPA explicitly states it **did not assign numerical scores** within the framework.\n- Any scoring would be created by **individual LPs**, not by ILPA itself.\n- KKR is mentioned only as a **working-group participant**, not as a firm with a published assessment result.\n\n## Direct answer to the question\n- **Bucket assigned to KKR by ILPA:** **Not available / not evidenced**\n- **Numerical score received by KKR:** **None published by ILPA**\n\n## Bottom line\nThere is **no support in the provided materials** for saying that ILPA assigned KKR a specific bucket or numerical score under the ILPA ESG Assessment Framework.",
